## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- `npm run build:full` to ensure TypeScript compliance and bundle success.

### Manual Verification
1. Open the dashboard.
2. Click the "**3D**" button in the map header.
3. Verify the Deck.gl map is replaced by a high-resolution 3D globe.
4. Verify the globe rotates automatically when idle.
5. Click "**2D**" and verify it switches back to the flat map without losing data markers.
